# PuQi Client

[![Platform](https://img.shields.io/badge/Platform-Windows%2010%20%2F%2011%20(x64)-blue?style=flat)](https://github.com/XuJun05/PuqiClient)
[![Minecraft](https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Bedrock%20Edition-brightgreen?style=flat)](https://www.minecraft.net)
[![DirectX](https://img.shields.io/badge/DirectX-11%20%2F%2012%20Native-0078D7?style=flat)](https://github.com/XuJun05/PuqiClient)
[![Language](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-C%2B%2B20-orange?style=flat)](https://github.com/XuJun05/PuqiClient)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-All%20Rights%20Reserved-red?style=flat)](LICENSE)

**PuQi Client** is a lightweight native utility and PVP client for Minecraft Bedrock Edition (Windows 10/11 x64), built in C++20 with DirectX 11/12 Present queue hooks and a frosted glass interface.

---

## Links

* **Source Code**: [GitHub](https://github.com/XuJun05/PuqiClient)
* **Issue Tracker**: [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/XuJun05/PuqiClient/issues)
* **Community**: [Discord Server](https://discord.gg/faSR5NHecV)

---

## Features

* **Music Player**: In-game audio player reading `.mp3`, `.wav`, and `.flac` files from `%APPDATA%\PuqiClient\Music`. Includes real-time equalizer bars and album art detection.
* **ArrayList**: Cheat-client style active module staircase list with length-based sorting and gradient wave animations.
* **Universal Keybindings**: Assign or clear custom hotkeys for every module directly from the ClickGUI.
* **Eject**: Press `[END]` to cleanly unhook and unload the DLL.

---

## Keybinds

* `[INSERT]` / `[Right Shift]` - Open / Close ClickGUI
* `[ESC]` - Close ClickGUI
* `[C]` (Hold) - Zoom
* `[V]` (Hold) - Freecam
* `[TAB]` (Hold) - Player list
* `[B]` - Toggle FullBright
* `[END]` - Unload client

> Note: Any module can be rebound in ClickGUI by clicking its keybind button and pressing a key. Press `[Backspace]`, `[Escape]`, or `[Delete]` to clear.

---

## Modules

* `Music Player` - In-game background audio playback and album art.
* `ArrayList` - Active module list with wave color modes.
* `Watermark` - Client branding and version display.
* `FPS Counter` - Real-time frame rate monitor.
* `CPS Counter` - Left and right clicks-per-second display.
* `Keystrokes` - Movement keys and mouse input tracker.
* `Coordinates` - XYZ position and Nether ratio coordinates.
* `Speedometer` - Movement speed in bps or km/h.
* `PingDisplay` - Server latency monitor.
* `TimeDisplay` - Real-world local clock.
* `Compass` - Directional heading indicator.
* `ToggleSprint` - Automatic sprint lock.
* `ArmorHUD` - Equipped armor and durability display.
* `PlayerList` - Connected server player list.
* `Custom Crosshair` - Configurable aiming reticle.
* `Zoom` - Smooth cinematic camera zoom.
* `SnapLock` - noob freelock.
* `FullBright` - Night vision cave brightness.
* `ThirdPerson Nametag` - Nametag display in third-person view.

---

## Directory Structure (`%APPDATA%\PuqiClient\`)

```text
%APPDATA%\PuqiClient\
├── Music\
│   ├── icon.png
│   └── (Your music files: .mp3, .wav, .flac)
├── avatar.png
└── config.json
```

---

### Requirements
* Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)
* Visual Studio 2022 with C++ desktop development workload


